1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,410
Agar tumhari pehli WordCamp hai, toh yeh video dekh lo.

2
00:00:03,410 --> 00:00:07,340
Kisi ko jaante nahi, samajh nahi aata baat kaise shuru karein.

3
00:00:07,340 --> 00:00:09,800
Aur 'Contributor Day' ka matlab bhi pata nahi hota.

4
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:13,210
Isiliye hai CampBuddy — tumhara digital saathi.

5
00:00:13,210 --> 00:00:15,220
Dekho CampBuddy mein kya kya milta hai.

6
00:00:15,220 --> 00:00:19,220
Home screen batata hai abhi kya karna chahiye.

7
00:00:19,220 --> 00:00:22,530
Sessions save karo, time se pehle reminder mil jaata hai.

8
00:00:22,530 --> 00:00:24,780
Ek chhoti checklist, poora din ek game jaisa lagta hai.

9
00:00:24,780 --> 00:00:27,520
'Kisi doosre shehar wale se milo' — ek task.

10
00:00:27,520 --> 00:00:29,820
'Sponsor area ghoom aao' — ek aur task.

11
00:00:29,820 --> 00:00:32,820
Apni pasand batao, waise hi log mil jaate hain.

12
00:00:32,820 --> 00:00:36,060
Kitni baar visiting card diya aur wo jeb mein hi kho gaya?

13
00:00:36,060 --> 00:00:38,820
Naam, kaam, aur ek QR code — sab ek jagah.

14
00:00:38,820 --> 00:00:42,070
QR scan karo, seedha LinkedIn khul jaata hai.

15
00:00:42,070 --> 00:00:44,770
Teen-chaar designs mein se apni pasand ka card chuno.

16
00:00:44,770 --> 00:00:47,460
Volunteer karna hai? apna rasta bhi mil jaata hai.

17
00:00:47,460 --> 00:00:51,450
Sponsors ke offers aur unki jaankari ek hi jagah dikh jaate hain.

18
00:00:51,450 --> 00:00:55,800
Koi account nahi, koi signup nahi — bas phone kholo aur shuru ho jao.

19
00:00:55,800 --> 00:00:59,160
campbuddy.club pe jaake abhi try karo — bilkul free hai.
